     A          R MSGSFL                    SFL
      *%%TS  SD  19970929  143815  RADDATZ     REL-V3R6M0  5716-PW1
     A  *DS3                                SFLMSGRCD(14)
     A  *DS4                                SFLMSGRCD(14)
     A            MSGKY                     SFLMSGKEY
